{"4890720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Galatria", "steam_appid": 4890720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GALATRIA</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap into the cockpit and take the fight across the stars. GALATRIA is a 3D arcade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shoot-'em-up that fuses the relentless wave assault of the best know 80's and 90's Games,  the multi-directional mayhem and the fast, replayable package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrolling 3D battlefields — pilot a fully 3D fighter over hand-crafted stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Island labyrinths — after every boss, a floating island maze drifts in from deep space. Thread the corridors at speed; the glowing walls mean instant death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dug-in gun emplacements — tanks, towers and spider-turrets track your every move and open fire; the tanks answer with homing rockets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss battles — massive capital ships that don't just vanish when beaten: watch them break apart, burn and drift away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade feel, modern polish— tight controls, a driving original soundtrack, punchy explosions, and a shield to save you in a pinch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow keys to fly, A to fire, S for your shield — fully rebindable. <br>Joysticks, Joypads, X-Box Controller</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far into the swarm can you get?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extras: </strong><br><strong>- Coop Play together (2 Player Mode) </strong><br><strong>- Coop Play against each other side by side in a Split Screen (party VS Mode) (only on 16:9 Resolutions)  </strong><br><strong>- Full Arcade Cabinet Support: (Aspects 3:4 and 9:16)</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GALATRIA</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap into the cockpit and take the fight across the stars. GALATRIA is a 3D arcade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shoot-'em-up that fuses the relentless wave assault of the best know 80's and 90's Games,  the multi-directional mayhem and the fast, replayable package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrolling 3D battlefields — pilot a fully 3D fighter over hand-crafted stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Island labyrinths — after every boss, a floating island maze drifts in from deep space. Thread the corridors at speed; the glowing walls mean instant death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dug-in gun emplacements — tanks, towers and spider-turrets track your every move and open fire; the tanks answer with homing rockets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss battles — massive capital ships that don't just vanish when beaten: watch them break apart, burn and drift away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade feel, modern polish— tight controls, a driving original soundtrack, punchy explosions, and a shield to save you in a pinch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow keys to fly, A to fire, S for your shield — fully rebindable. <br>Joysticks, Joypads, X-Box Controller</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far into the swarm can you get?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extras: </strong><br><strong>- Coop Play together (2 Player Mode) </strong><br><strong>- Coop Play against each other side by side in a Split Screen (party VS Mode) (only on 16:9 Resolutions)  </strong><br><strong>- Full Arcade Cabinet Support: (Aspects 3:4 and 9:16)</strong></p>", "short_description": "A fast, retro 3D arcade shoot-'em-up. Pilot your fighter across scrolling battlefields, thread floating island labyrinths where one wrong move is fatal, and blast through relentless waves and screen-filling bosses. Inspired by the 80's and 90's Arcade Games of the Times.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890720/da17485797f1d0003ed5c2df855a3bbd0bcfea69/header.jpg?t=1784387642", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890720/bc365fac8d454f717abe0ea8b49e0fa5dbf1447d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784387642", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890720/bc365fac8d454f717abe0ea8b49e0fa5dbf1447d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784387642", "website": "https://games.hsys.at/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-Core 2.0 GHz (Intel Core i3 / AMD gleichwertig)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Vulkan-1.1-fähige GPU (z. B. Intel HD 620 oder besser)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectSound-kompatibel<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Benötigt eine GPU mit Vulkan-1.0-Unterstützung. Einzelspieler, keine Internetverbindung nötig.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-Core, 2,5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedizierte GPU der Klasse GeForce GTX 1050 / Radeon RX 560<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectSound-kompatibel<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Benötigt eine G